# Credits self-check (mandatory)

Before expensive Cloud work, run the dashboard self-check. Full task: `docs/CURSOR_CREDITS_SELF_CHECK.md`. Tool (Mac Mini or live box): `python3 sailingsa/scripts/cursor_credits_self_check.py audit`.

## Stop conditions

1. Call `cursor-cloud-run-info`. If this run is public Cloud (`usePrivateWorker` false) and a Mac Mini worker is connected/idle, **SailingSA work stops** unless the user explicitly asked for Cloud in this message (or this is the credits monitor).
2. Call `cursor-cloud-list-cloud-agents` with `RUNNING`. Do not spawn more agents if another is already RUNNING.
3. Do not use Opus / Max / high-thinking / Best-of-N. Do not start recurring Cloud timers.
4. Do not launch subagents unless the user asked.

